  "description": "JOYSTAR Little Daisy Girls' Bike - Sizes 12\" to 20\"\nLet your little princess ride in style with the JOYSTAR Little Daisy Girls' Bike. Featuring a charming vintage-inspired design and delightful accessories, this bike is specifically engineered for girls aged 2-10 to build confidence and joy on two wheels.\n\nThe perfect princess ride: JOYSTAR Little Daisy with wicker basket and doll seat.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Designed for maximum enjoyment, the Little Daisy features adjustable components and intuitive safety systems to grow with your child.\"\nSafer Riding Features\nThe Little Daisy is equipped with a dual-braking system: a front hand caliper brake for learning precision stopping and a rear coaster brake for intuitive foot-power braking. The sturdy steel frame ensures durability, while the wide 2.125\" pneumatic tires provide extra stability on any path.\n\nSmooth pedaling and stable handling for confident first rides.\n\nChild-Friendly Ergonomics\n\nDual Brakes: Front handbrake and rear coaster/foot brake for ample stopping power.\n\nProtection: Fully enclosed chain guard prevents contact with moving parts.\n\nAdjustability: Quick-release saddle and stem for easy height adjustments as she grows.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nWe know you want to get riding fast. The Little Daisy arrives 85% pre-assembled. All necessary assembly tools and easy-to-follow instructions are included in the box.\n\nWatch: Get your Little Daisy ready for the road in minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch the Little Daisy in action: Stylish, charming, and fun.\n\nOur Guarantee\nYour purchase is protected by our Limited Lifetime Warranty on the frame.",
